  "goodToKnow": "Die Bewässerung is irrigation or watering: künstliche Bewässerung, Tröpfchenbewässerung (drip irrigation). After several dry summers, farmers in regions like Brandenburg and Lower Saxony increasingly rely on irrigation, and some districts restrict garden watering during droughts. Bewässern means to irrigate; the opposite is entwässern (to drain). Plural: die Bewässerungen."
